        {"zh": "你会照顾我吗", "en": "Will you look after me?"},
        {"zh": "我不喜欢吵架", "en": "I don't like quarrels."},
        {"zh": "你太高，我看不清脸", "en": "You're too tall; I can't see your face."},
        {"zh": "我对生人有点怯", "en": "I'm a bit shy of strangers."},
        {"zh": "你的手很稳当", "en": "Your hands are steady."},
        {"zh": "你想跟我做朋友吗", "en": "Would you be my friend?"},
        {"zh": "我还不习惯有人靠近", "en": "I'm not used to anyone close."},
        {"zh": "我会慢慢长大", "en": "I'll grow up."},
        {"zh": "我们慢慢认识吧", "en": "Let's get to know each other slowly."},
        {"zh": "你要带我去哪里", "en": "Where are you taking me?"},
        {"zh": "我会跟着你走", "en": "I'll follow you."},
        {"zh": "你别突然动弹", "en": "Don't move abruptly."},
        {"zh": "我听见你身边的动静", "en": "I hear things moving around you."}
      ]
    },
